			"notes": "Initial Release\n\nIf you pick-block a chest, you get a chest item with it's contents. With this mod, you can do the same with blocks with blockstates. For example stairs: If you pick-block a upside down, west facing stair, then no matter what what way you're facing, it'll always be upside down, facing west."
